#{[17592186381262 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381262 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381262 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "238d2bb5-2057-5938-92cb-490c8fd1d052" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381263 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{3}{4}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381263 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381263 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "007df772-538e-5628-b388-eb1493c3de4c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381264 #edb/ref 1080 "-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381264 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381264 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e31f346f-c25e-5e5e-9897-5f3acda1e293" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381265 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186381266 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381265 #edb/ref 1069 "q-159707" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381265 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381265 #edb/ref 1071 "For the function $f(x,y)=\\frac{{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}{{e}^{y-x}},$ evaluate $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}$ at the point $(1,-1).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381265 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6f6e1b67-30d1-5d26-980f-cea342aa0dc8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381265 #edb/ref 1074 "We differentiate the given function with respect to $x,$ treating all other variables as constants. \n\nFirst, we use the quotient and chain rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}{{e}^{y-x}}) & =\\frac{\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\cdot {e}^{y-x}-({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{y-x})}{{({e}^{y-x})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x\\cdot {e}^{y-x}-({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\cdot {e}^{y-x}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(y-x)}{{({e}^{y-x})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x{e}^{y-x}-({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\cdot {e}^{y-x}\\cdot (-1)}{{({e}^{y-x})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x+{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}){e}^{y-x}}{{({e}^{y-x})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x+{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}{{e}^{y-x}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(1,-1):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}{|}_{(1,-1)} & =\\frac{2(1)+{1}^{2}-(-1)^{2}}{{e}^{-1-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2+1-1}{{e}^{-2}} \\\\  & =2{e}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381267 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381268 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381269 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381270 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381271 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186381267 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381266 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "c43d33af-7b21-5589-9d8f-5fccd66d3600" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381267 #edb/ref 1080 "2{e}^{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381267 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381267 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8367eed8-8db9-5b16-8030-4fb1d45343f2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381268 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{2}{{e}^{2}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381268 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381268 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c3f7d926-4b2e-5a47-a964-89bbf3409d2d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381269 #edb/ref 1080 "2-e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381269 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381269 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c0684d01-ce2e-5d72-b7c5-5083711bc071" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381270 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381270 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381270 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3e29fb6f-8142-5709-a889-a0d7208a0ba2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381271 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381271 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17